Name of Program or Group of Programs Submitted: GREGRevision Number and/or Date of this version: 6   Language: C_MW.68000Type of Program (category): MISC.   Format: SOURCE & OBJECTBrief Description of Function: Example of a routine to convert julian dateformat back to gregorian date format for 68000 OS-9Summary of Operating Instructions: greg [julian-date]Other Software Required: Dave Partington's "DEFS.C"OS-9 Level: ALL   OS-9 Version: 1.1,1.2   Computer System: Compcontrol 68000Printer Requirements:   Terminal Requirements:Other Hardware Requirements:Submitted by:  PARTINGTON, DAVID J.#####################################################################Wandelt Julian-Date ins normate Datumsformat um.( "date -j" liefert das aktuelle Datum im Julian-Format)#####################################################################